{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1381512851717089", "organization": {"id": "1381482621720112", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1381512851717089"}]}, "id": "1090940373737413"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "1381512851717089", "release_date": 1793447460, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1422582630943444"}, "id": "1468690935161329"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1381512851717089", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1422582630943444"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "1388891650979209", "version": "0.3.7", "version_code": 10, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1792508419, "id": "1381512861717088", "is_initial_release": true, "name_with_fallback": "v1", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 1, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "1381512858383755"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "1381512851717089"}, "id": "1381512858383755", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": true, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1381512851717089", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "39396943246618933"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1652132016925354", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BenioWorld", "keywords": ["cinema", "multiplayer", "amigos", "filmes", "aconchegante"], "long_description": "**Sua tela. Seu mundo. Seus amigos.**\n\nBenioWorld \u00e9 um lugar aconchegante pra ficar de boa em VR. Escolha um mundo, coloque uma tela gigante onde quiser e assista junto, ou levante e v\u00e1 jogar.\n\n### \ud83c\udfac Assista de tudo, numa tela do seu tamanho\n- **Navegador integrado** com o YouTube a um toque\n- **Seus pr\u00f3prios v\u00eddeos**, direto do headset, sem PC nem internet\n- **Canais de TV** das suas pr\u00f3prias listas (.m3u / .m3u8)\n- Deixe a tela **do tamanho, na dist\u00e2ncia e com a curvatura** que quiser\n- **Ambilight** espalha as cores da tela pelo ambiente\n\n### \ud83c\udf34 10 mundos pra curtir\nPraia ao p\u00f4r do sol, cobertura na cidade, cinema, cabine de avi\u00e3o, motorhome na estrada, s\u00f3t\u00e3o aconchegante, sal\u00e3o de jogos, quarto, est\u00fadio e escrivaninha com janela. Troque entre **dia, p\u00f4r do sol e noite** quando quiser e controle as luzes de cada mundo.\n\n### \ud83d\udc65 Melhor junto\n- Crie uma sala e **assista sincronizado**: o anfitri\u00e3o compartilha o mapa, as luzes e a tela\n- Entre em **salas online p\u00fablicas**, chame os amigos com um **c\u00f3digo de sala** ou jogue em **rede local (LAN)**\n- Use seu pr\u00f3prio visual com **avatares VRM** e express\u00f5es\n\n### \ud83c\udfb3 Pra fazer entre um epis\u00f3dio e outro\n- **Boliche** com placar de verdade, **sinuca**, **pebolim** e **basquete**\n- **Ludo** na mesa de centro, uma **lousa** pra desenhar\n- Um **viol\u00e3o** que d\u00e1 pra tocar de verdade, **fogos de artif\u00edcio**, **chap\u00e9us** pra usar\n- Um **celular** que funciona, com c\u00e2mera, m\u00fasica e r\u00e1dio ao vivo, e uma **c\u00e2mera instant\u00e2nea** que imprime suas fotos\n- Pegue, arremesse e mude o tamanho dos objetos com f\u00edsica e **armas de ferramenta**", "short_description": "Assista ao YouTube, filmes e seus pr\u00f3prios v\u00eddeos numa tela gigante com os amigos, e depois jogue boliche, sinuca, pebolim e muito mais em 10 mundos aconchegantes, de uma praia ao p\u00f4r do sol a uma cobertura na cidade."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon-zoomed-transparent.png", "id": "3529736067189478", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_FOREGROUND_512", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654956704_3529736073856144_2216937045479860810_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sdk_A6hf3P4Q7kNvwGDhTPH&_nc_oc=AdqrQd4yEs85AqxOh03nRzxLKx5M8C6QPH6lSNU7sYyu2_u7NST-0mfwOFZjnD1GKOY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQOu6iBlIsE7LmQvLF0EzHO3-zoj3SjAi9YZbyc9UsFzg&oe=6AFF1F28"}, {"file_name": "icon-zoomed.png", "id": "1776240773592485", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1776240776925818_3264658965924429242_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TeVpJ8wFsj4Q7kNvwEtee2s&_nc_oc=Ado2_S7SDnG-Sdj_xifU57PknrMb2lDYpRqxr9UX6pwDs_BbZoV7BTFk5YWQM-YC9rM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQet_3SaDWAb0EwmEDs6nOwYKYX1IMlFjFB28CB332jcQ&oe=6AFF1B33"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT.png", "id": "1613806753803697", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_1613806760470363_2520359572816066534_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7hPtuFasHKUQ7kNvwGWhaIk&_nc_oc=Adr_xtiC1_XhEKyUEi1luNAzfy1kFJQDuxenPSVQuxIw38wzukTKWJXK_YUb_jPDYC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRCjIntJYsipVP2IsiCFo83t1tKNr_Ee6rYUepXeG2TGw&oe=6AFF3231"}, {"file_name": "layered_icon_composited.png", "id": "1579514893487644", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LAYERED_ICON_512", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604347072_